1 ABOUT
   govax is a project of Forest Edge Software.  The emulator is an
   effort to emulate the behavior of a VAX 8600 class processor.

   For more information, write:

       Forest Edge Software
       112 Forest Edge Drive
       Raleigh NC 27518

   or email

      tom.cole@forest-edge.net

   govax is Open Source, you are free to download the source from
   https://github.com/tucats/govax. IF you find bugs, please open
   a GitHub issue!

   The core VAX emulation, assembler/disassembler, and console was
   originally written in C by Tom Cole, with additional contributions
   from:

       Carl Fongheiser
       Hartmut Becker
       Sergey Tikhonov


   The Go version, MACRO assembler, LINKER, and DEBUG facility were
   written by Tom Cole, supported by Sonnet 5 and Opus 5.5 LLM models
   via Claude Code.
